{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11302480","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11302480","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1130248001:1":{"text":"角笛の合図を待ってるんだ。それが鳴ったら、俺は太鼓を叩き始めるのさ。","source_cn":"我在等号角吹响，然后跟随号角声，我会开始敲击战鼓。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9CC7462194870723","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130248002:1":{"text":"太鼓が鳴ってる時は、荒涼の砂漠にいる勇士たちの心臓も高鳴るんだ。","source_cn":"当战鼓响起时，荒角沙漠勇士们的心脏也会随之跳动。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F831FC6449A2376","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130248003:1":{"text":"太鼓が鳴り止まらない限り、戦いも終わらないんだ。","source_cn":"战鼓不停，战斗不止。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x633916D46421B7A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:蛮血克里比特":{"text":"ババリアのクリピト","source":"蛮血克里比特","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}